      "writtenOn": "2022-11-21T19:44:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If this is false by default, then this change really needs to have a job (at least a `Build` job) added where this is true. There is currently nothing keeping any of this compiling, or even verifying here that it is compiling. In particular, since this basically enables building in parts of ICU, we really should be running an UBSAN build and test on this in some configuration that will complain loudly on ODR violations.",
      "revId": "c963247ceacff4106fc1e30283204f10e445cda9",
