      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-21T19:44:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is awkward, in that this is basically a small build of part of icu, and it should be obvious that this target is, in fact, a \"mini-icu\". In other words, this target and the \"icu\" target should be mutually exclusive, only one should be available to be depend on in a given build (somehow depending on this target and also depending on the `icu` target below should be impossible).\n\nIf that isn\u0027t possible then we need to ensure that none of these symbols end up exported. One would need to at least remove `U_DISABLE_RENAMING` and set things up so these symbols all have a `skia_icu` prefix on them or something.",
      "revId": "c963247ceacff4106fc1e30283204f10e445cda9",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    }
